    "detailed_description": "Embark on a surreal journey through the eerie realm of &quot;Phantasia&quot; \ud83e\ude84\ud83d\udd2e<br><br>A game where survival isn't just a goal; it's a race against time. As darkness falls, you're thrust into a recurring dream, a haunting ground teeming with mutants whose only desire is to ensure you never see past 6 AM. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076860/extras/7f1fc0a6ccbe699533a63a61c1bf8378.poster.avif?t=1704997754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076860/extras/7f1fc0a6ccbe699533a63a61c1bf8378.webm?t=1704997754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076860/extras/7f1fc0a6ccbe699533a63a61c1bf8378.mp4?t=1704997754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>But there's power at your fingertips. <br>Defeat your foes and harness an evolving arsenal of spells they leave behind. Adapt quickly, strategize on the go, and wield your newfound abilities to turn the tide in your favor. \ud83d\udcaa\ud83e\udddd\u200d\u2640\ufe0f<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076860/extras/5e2d0042723cca37da1b7728a4de12c3.poster.avif?t=1704997754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076860/extras/5e2d0042723cca37da1b7728a4de12c3.webm?t=1704997754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076860/extras/5e2d0042723cca37da1b7728a4de12c3.mp4?t=1704997754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Eli has the opportunity to recon and gather inventory for his colony. He has been stuck underground, growing up, training and learning. It is your turn to put him to the test!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076860/extras/2407012d24d4316fc709e20c5f638abb.poster.avif?t=1704997754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076860/extras/2407012d24d4316fc709e20c5f638abb.webm?t=1704997754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076860/extras/2407012d24d4316fc709e20c5f638abb.mp4?t=1704997754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Are you prepared to face what comes with the night? In the world of &quot;Phantasia,&quot; waking up is the hardest part.",
