im to the test!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076860/extras/2407012d24d4316fc709e20c5f638abb.poster.avif?t=1704997754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076860/extras/2407012d24d4316fc709e20c5f638abb.webm?t=1704997754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076860/extras/2407012d24d4316fc709e20c5f638abb.mp4?t=1704997754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Are you prepared to face what comes with the night? In the world of &quot;Phantasia,&quot; waking up is the hardest part.",
